**axis.cpp maps sticks to labels and computes stick-vector magnitude.**

## Symbols

- `to_string(stick s) noexcept -> const char*`: returns `"left"`/`"right"`; unknown values fall back to `"left"`.
- `stick_vector::magnitude() const noexcept -> float`: computes `sqrt(x*x + y*y)` via `<cmath>`.